Baik.

27:21.680 --> 27:23.380
Jika awak lapar,

27:23.660 --> 27:25.440
pergi makan di tempat Mak Ma

27:26.020 --> 27:28.620
dan bawa ikan salai ke sana.

27:29.520 --> 27:30.220
Baik.

27:38.440 --> 27:40.480
Jika awak tak mahu belajar,

27:40.510 --> 27:41.980
pergilah belajar memasak.

27:43.670 --> 27:45.570
Memandangkan awak suka,

27:46.220 --> 27:47.330
