Tak beritahu saya pun.

30:15.880 --> 30:18.160
Tak beritahu pun.

30:19.400 --> 30:20.200
Tak beritahu pun.

30:20.200 --> 30:21.590
Berhati-hati.

30:41.300 --> 30:42.370
Mari minum.

30:42.430 --> 30:43.120
Mari.

30:44.640 --> 30:45.310
Mari.

30:45.530 --> 30:46.480
Mari.

30:57.330 --> 30:58.600
Cakaplah, apa hal itu?

31:04.490 --> 31:05.500
Zhou,

31:07.090 --> 31:08.580
